+// an unsupported task id, extra 3 = an undefined op):
+//   0  p2 turns in before anyone accepted                   -> NotActive (18)
+//   1  both accept at the same tick                          -> one Accepted, one Active (16)
+//   2  (patches appear: the holder's half beside the holder, the rest beside
